  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "misalignment of the MOD finger on the stationary barrel which led to hot spot generation and a thermal runaway failure. Factors contributing to the misalignment include extra spacing gaps on certain MOD fingers, and lack of refurbishment program leading to spring degradation over time. Additionally, McGuire did not implement sufficient risk mitigation and elimination measures, nor provide oversight for MODs, resulting from the failure to recognize the passive component as a single-point vulnerability",
    "cause_code": "E",
    "category": "Management/QA Deficiency",
    "theme": "inadequate MOD maintenance/refurbishment program and failure to recognize single-point vulnerability",
    "provisional": false
  },
